# Changelog — v1.3.0

* Fixed music player synchronization issues.
* Fixed background playback issues in the music player.
* Fixed lag and touch-interception issues in the music player WebView.
* Added **Next** and **Previous** track buttons to music playback notifications.
* Added volume and brightness gesture controls to the music player.
* Fixed music playback not working correctly in mini-player mode.
* Added an **audio-only playback plan** for music.
* Added an option to use the **YouTube WebView player** instead of ExoPlayer for video playback.
* Added volume and brightness gesture controls for webview player.
* Added **SponsorBlock** support.
* Added additional playback speed options.
* Improved playback controls and overall interaction.
* Added volume and brightness gesture controls for shorts player.
* Fixed Shorts player starting in a muted state.
* Added support for downloading Shorts.
* Fixed the inability to disable subtitles in the offline player.
* Fixed the subtitle icon not being grayed out when subtitles were disabled.
* Fixed the **pull-to-refresh** gesture being active on pages where it should not be.
* Improved the colors and visibility of download status chips.
* Added the **Shorts** tab to the channel page in the Shorts-hiding toggle.
* Improved overall playback stability and user interaction.